# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# Everything in public/ is copied to the build output root, so this file lands
# at out/_redirects where Cloudflare Pages picks it up. Next's own redirects()
# config does NOT work here — it's a server feature and this site is a static
# export (output: "export" in next.config.ts).
#
# /donate -> /sponsorship (2026-07-23): the giving page was renamed when Carol
# moved the site from donation language to sponsorship language. Keep this rule
# indefinitely — /donate was live and may already be printed on flyers or sent
# in emails, and a 301 preserves the search ranking the old URL had earned.
/donate /sponsorship 301
